  "goodToKnow": "Der Flieger is a casual word for a plane: Ich nehme den Flieger. The standard word is das Flugzeug. Der Flieger also means an aviator or pilot (die Fliegerin), and der Ferienflieger is a holiday airline. Historically, die Flieger were air force pilots, as in the Red Baron, der Rote Baron Manfred von Richthofen. From fliegen (to fly). Plural: die Flieger."
